# LIBRIX Backend - Environment Variables Example
# Set these in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.

# Allowed Frontend Origins for CORS (comma-separated).
# https://ds-project-olive.vercel.app is allowed by default in main.py.
# Add custom domains or staging URLs here if needed:
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://ds-project-olive.vercel.app,http://localhost:5173

# Optional: Persistent Database URL (PostgreSQL, Supabase, Neon, or SQLite)
# If provided, catalog mutations persist across serverless cold starts.
# Example PostgreSQL / Supabase: postgresql://postgres:YOUR_PASSWORD@db.YOUR_HOST.supabase.co:5432/postgres
# If left blank, atomic JSON persistence in /tmp is used (demo mode).
DATABASE_URL=
